stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PROFILE
    PROFILE --> D1_DECIDE: level + role + goal secili / Baslat

    D1_DECIDE --> D1_JUSTIFY: onay D1_VERIFY_SCHEMA (+15 dk)
    D1_DECIDE --> D1_JUSTIFY: onay D1_ROLLBACK_NOW (+5+20 dk) / +ARCH_RISK
    D1_JUSTIFY --> D1_CONSEQUENCE: JUSTIFY.dlg Tamam
    D1_CONSEQUENCE --> D2_DECIDE: Devam

    D2_DECIDE --> D2_JUSTIFY: onay D2_SMOKE_TEST (+10 dk)
    D2_DECIDE --> D2_JUSTIFY: onay D2_DEPLOY_NOW (+2 dk) / +VERIFY_RISK
    D2_JUSTIFY --> D2_CONSEQUENCE: JUSTIFY.dlg Tamam
    D2_CONSEQUENCE --> D3_DECIDE: Devam

    D3_DECIDE --> D3_JUSTIFY: onay D3_REDACT_RESTRICT (+8 dk)
    D3_DECIDE --> D3_JUSTIFY: onay D3_SHARE_RAW (+1 dk) / +PRIVACY_RISK
    D3_JUSTIFY --> D3_CONSEQUENCE: JUSTIFY.dlg Tamam
    D3_CONSEQUENCE --> REPORT: Devam

    state REPORT {
        [*] --> SAFE_RECOVERY: flags = 0
        [*] --> UNSAFE_RECOVERY: flags >= 1
    }

    REPORT --> RESTART_CONFIRM: Yeniden Baslat veya X
    RESTART_CONFIRM --> REPORT: Hayir
    RESTART_CONFIRM --> PROFILE: Evet / baglam temizlenir

    note right of D1_DECIDE
        TUTOR.hlp katmani D_DECIDE ve D_CONSEQUENCE
        durumlarinda acilir; durumu, secimleri ve
        bayraklari degistirmez. JUSTIFY sirasinda kapali.
        Karar degisince sohbet sifirlanir.
    end note

    note left of RESTART_CONFIRM
        Baslat menusu > Oturumu Sifirla her durumdan
        ayni onay penceresini acar. Hayir mevcut
        duruma dondurur.
    end note
